<title>CHINA: Trading in AWT World shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in AWT World shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of AWT World Transport Holdings Ltd was suspended on Wednesday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>The company's shares rose HK$0.34, or 33 percent, to HK$1.37 on Tuesday. Volume was 155.63 million shares worth HK$194.92 million.</p>
<p>AWT World provides international air and sea freight forwarding services.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
